# A write through node changes the field of the space above the method; a write to the bare name changes only the value
# of the activation (the book, node and #dynamic; plan M11 5b part 2): after bare(5) the root's hits is still 4, after
# put(9) it is 9.
int: hits 4
sub: bare (int: v)
    hits := v
sub: put (int: v)
    node\hits := v
bare(5)
int: after_bare hits
put(9)
int: after_put hits
